{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Mercenaria is a third-person shooter and role-playing game featuring beautiful girls. You will play as a female college student who joins a mercenary organization due to her disdain for studying, and embark on a series of thrilling missions, fighting against an evil secret organization.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling gun battles in missions and win bonuses by completing them;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain supplies from the enemy's backpack;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience interesting interactions with other mercenaries;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Admire the beautiful scenery on the distant isolated island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This game's account data is stored locally on your device only. No information is sent to any server.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747740?t=1755969076","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747740?t=1755969076","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747740/4c8dc78eaddb4fd9308c10713f7c6524e529798b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755969076","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747740/4c8dc78eaddb4fd9308c10713f7c6524e529798b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755969076","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Mercenaria is a third-person shooter and role-playing game featuring beautiful girls. You will play as a female college student who joins a mercenary organization due to her disdain for studying, and embark on a series of thrilling missions, fighting against an evil secret organization.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ex